  "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T21:52:35.001452Z",
  "totalBlocks": 33,
  "translatedBlocks": 33,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2927944b5bc20a45",
      "translationZh": "贡献者：David Austin、Raja Biswas、Gilberto Titericz Junior、NVIDIA",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a3a2f64798db171",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA 的 AI-Q Blueprint——领先的可移植、开放式深度研究智能体——最近登上了 Hugging Face 上 DeepResearch Bench 的“LLM with Search”排行榜榜首。这标志着开源 AI 技术栈向前迈出了重要一步，证明开发者可获取的模型能够支持高级智能体工作流，其表现可媲美甚至超越封闭式替代方案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0d77b6b5d7918744",
      "translationZh": "AI-Q 的独特之处是什么？它融合了两个高性能开放式 LLM——Llama 3.3-70B Instruct 和 Llama-3.3-Nemotron-Super-49B-v1.5——以协调长上下文检索、智能体推理和稳健的信息综合。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "108a2d38b2cb5e71",
      "translationZh": "核心技术栈：模型选择与技术创新",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2c5439619a78b913",
      "translationZh": "Llama 3.3-70B Instruct：流畅、结构化报告生成的基础，源自 Meta 的 Llama 系列，并采用开放许可，支持不受限制的部署。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7fc3886b5748a4fe",
      "translationZh": "Llama-3.3-Nemotron-Super-49B-v1.5：经过优化、专注于推理的变体。它通过神经架构搜索（NAS）、知识蒸馏以及连续多轮监督学习和强化学习构建而成，擅长多步推理、查询规划、工具使用和反思，同时降低了内存占用，以便在标准 GPU 上高效部署。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a43fd089122746aa",
      "translationZh": "AI-Q 参考示例还包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "13163b88f23013c5",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA NeMo Retriever，用于可扩展的多模态搜索（内部+外部）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "201d3550b3678f88",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA NeMo Agent toolkit，用于编排复杂的多步骤智能体工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3908d3364ff04346",
      "translationZh": "该架构支持对本地和网络数据进行并行、低延迟搜索，非常适合有隐私、合规要求，或需要通过本地部署来降低延迟的用例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fb3b6480eaadcc25",
      "translationZh": "使用 Llama Nemotron 进行深度推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2c3b87fd309391e",
      "translationZh": "NVIDIA Llama Nemotron Super 不只是一个经过微调的指令模型——它经过了针对显式智能体推理的后训练，并支持通过系统提示词切换推理的 ON/OFF 状态。你可以在标准聊天 LLM 模式下使用它，也可以切换到深度思维链推理，用于智能体流水线——从而实现动态、上下文敏感的工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6084d180b590c678",
      "translationZh": "主要亮点：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fa23167cdd79d11b",
      "translationZh": "多阶段后训练：结合指令遵循、数学/程序化推理和工具调用能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "961856a6977f1024",
      "translationZh": "透明的模型谱系：可直接追溯至 Meta 的开放权重，并进一步公开合成数据和调优数据集的相关信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dd1327992a25cb68",
      "translationZh": "效率：49B 参数、上下文窗口最高可达 128K tokens，可在单张 H100 GPU 或更小规格的 GPU 上运行，使推理成本保持可预测，同时实现快速推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a1a0a8461503e1a1",
      "translationZh": "评估：指标的透明度与稳健性",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c48070e2f68df950",
      "translationZh": "AI-Q 的核心优势之一是透明度——不仅体现在输出上，也体现在推理轨迹和中间步骤上。在开发过程中，NVIDIA 团队采用了标准指标和新指标，例如：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9cfdb2cd4277721b",
      "translationZh": "幻觉检测：在生成时核查每一项事实性声明。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7cdb792050e28bb4",
      "translationZh": "多来源综合：从不同的证据中综合提炼出新的见解。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2f7c4abcd26778ea",
      "translationZh": "引用可信度：自动评估声明与证据之间的关联。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f8547a75b1276eb9",
      "translationZh": "RAGAS 指标：对检索增强生成的准确性进行自动评分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f23b115f8e69fae9",
      "translationZh": "该架构非常适合进行细粒度、分步骤的评估与调试——这是智能体流水线开发中最大的痛点之一。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4bc0d518e610ab55",
      "translationZh": "基准测试结果：DeepResearch Bench",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b4d0a3f33d517b35",
      "translationZh": "DeepResearch Bench 使用一组 100+ 项长上下文、真实世界的研究任务来评估智能体技术栈，涵盖科学、金融、艺术、历史、软件等领域。与传统问答不同，这些任务要求进行报告篇幅的综合分析和复杂的多跳推理：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9480cb38a19e7b43",
      "translationZh": "截至 2025 年 8 月，AI-Q 在 LLM with Search 类别中取得了 40.52 的总分，目前在所有完全采用开放许可证的技术栈中位居榜首。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "713ab1e821721888",
      "translationZh": "表现最强的指标：全面性（报告深度）、洞察力（分析质量）和引用质量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e3254658f930119a",
      "translationZh": "面向 Hugging Face 开发者社区",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4488b631775cf400",
      "translationZh": "Llama-3.3-Nemotron-Super-49B-v1.5 和 Llama 3.3-70B Instruct 均可在 Hugging Face 上直接使用或下载。只需几行 Python 即可在自己的流水线中试用它们，也可以通过 vLLM 部署，以获得快速推理和工具调用支持（代码和服务部署示例请参阅模型卡）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9aeed3f1e45e6302",
      "translationZh": "开放的后训练数据、透明的评估方法和宽松的许可授权，为实验和可复现性提供了支持。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2aa37a775e9a7bbf",
      "translationZh": "要点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "04e09b425edac7c8",
      "translationZh": "在具有实际意义的真实世界智能体任务上，开源生态系统正迅速缩小差距，并且在某些领域已处于领先地位。基于 Llama Nemotron 构建的 AI-Q 表明，要取得最先进的成果，并不需要牺牲透明度或控制权。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d6bc0deb9651db8f",
      "translationZh": "通过 Hugging Face 或 build.nvidia.com 试用这套技术栈，或将其调整用于你自己的研究智能体项目。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
